WEBVTT

00:04.471 --> 00:11.673
Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~

00:12.846 --> 00:19.581
No matter where
you are, I'll find you.

00:20.987 --> 00:28.018
I can only watch you...
I can't even talk to you.

00:28.128 --> 00:32.588
Today is going to end,
and we can't see tomorrow.

00:33.166 --> 00:35.794
But they'll turn into a gentle colour.

00:37.437 --> 00:43.899
It whirls down from
the sky... Love will shine.

00:44.377 --> 00:52.409
<i>When I turn around,
I always see your smile.</i>

00:53.720 --> 01:01.126
1 wish a day like that would come.

01:01.361 --> 01:09.200
I want to keep
looking at you up close.

01:09.969 --> 01:16.431
I'm sending these great
feelings that never end...

01:16.643 --> 01:21.603
...straight to you.

01:56.583 --> 01:57.948
Yasuna...

01:58.418 --> 02:03.549
Things That Disappeared
from Yasuna's Eyes

02:07.327 --> 02:08.351
Why?

02:10.096 --> 02:11.688
I trusted you...

02:13.299 --> 02:14.266
Why?

02:14.868 --> 02:15.835
Wait.

02:17.837 --> 02:19.134
I..

02:19.506 --> 02:21.633
I also trusted you!

02:23.409 --> 02:25.741
What are you talking about?

02:48.635 --> 02:51.126
<i>You said I was your friend.</i>

02:51.237 --> 02:52.966
For the first time...

02:53.072 --> 02:54.937
Joking and fooling around...

02:55.041 --> 02:59.375
I thought you could be the very
first friend that I could really trust!

03:00.480 --> 03:05.679
I didn't say to keep our relationship
like this just for Hazumu's sake.

03:06.286 --> 03:09.084
I really wanted
to be friends with you.

03:14.527 --> 03:15.960
Then why...

03:16.396 --> 03:19.888
Why were you in Hazumu's
arms yesterday afternoon?

03:22.468 --> 03:23.867
Tomari, that was...

03:24.037 --> 03:26.437
You're the one who betrayed me!

03:27.307 --> 03:30.037
Kurusu, you're...

03:41.821 --> 03:43.186
Yasuna?

03:45.158 --> 03:46.284
Hazu...

03:52.465 --> 03:53.432
No...

03:53.967 --> 03:54.956
Yasuna?

03:56.169 --> 03:58.660
I don't want this...

04:00.406 --> 04:01.532
Yasuna!

04:03.076 --> 04:04.976
Are you okay, Yasuna?

04:05.078 --> 04:07.478
Wake up, Yasuna! Yasuna!

04:10.650 --> 04:15.485
<i>I think you should take her to the
university hospital for observation.</i>

04:15.822 --> 04:19.258
Let me know if you need
anything after she wakes up.

04:19.359 --> 04:20.383
Right.

04:20.493 --> 04:22.461
Thank you very much.

04:36.943 --> 04:40.310
The doctor said she just
had a light case of shock.

04:40.713 --> 04:41.839
I see...

04:47.487 --> 04:51.048
They said Yasuna's mother
will be here soon.

04:51.157 --> 04:54.251
<i>I think you should get some sleep.</i>

04:55.094 --> 04:56.220
No...

04:56.362 --> 04:57.624
I'll stay here.

04:57.730 --> 04:58.594
But...

04:58.698 --> 05:01.531
<i>I want to stay by her side.</i>

05:02.769 --> 05:03.895
Hazumu...

05:13.613 --> 05:16.343
Thank you very much for everything.

05:26.225 --> 05:29.160
Maybe we're not
in her field of vision...

05:29.362 --> 05:32.024
It seemed like she couldn't see us.

05:32.265 --> 05:33.391
Yeah...

05:35.902 --> 05:37.529
Could it be...

05:54.220 --> 05:55.754
What'll you do when you get back?

05:55.755 --> 05:57.484
What'll you do when you get back?
Homework of course!

05:57.590 --> 06:00.320
Do you know how much I have left?

06:00.760 --> 06:02.751
I had it taken care of.

06:02.862 --> 06:04.989
What's that supposed to mean?

06:12.372 --> 06:16.706
I'm sorry to tell you this,
but her condition is getting worse.

06:16.809 --> 06:21.473
She not only finds it difficult
to recognize men, but women as well.

06:24.050 --> 06:25.074
Yasuna.

06:27.220 --> 06:29.017
Shall we go home?

06:31.824 --> 06:32.722
Sure.

06:46.038 --> 06:47.335
Excuse me...

06:51.544 --> 06:53.512
What do you want to do?

07:02.555 --> 07:05.183
I just thought that might be it...

07:07.660 --> 07:11.858
You were really frightened back then.

07:14.534 --> 07:18.595
I thought that maybe
you couldn't see me or Tomari.

07:20.640 --> 07:23.473
It's not just you or Kurusu...

07:24.277 --> 07:26.336
Both men and women.

07:27.580 --> 07:29.514
Every human being...

07:32.285 --> 07:34.879
You and your lukewarm feelings...

07:35.955 --> 07:39.015
Not just for me,
but for Kurusu as well.

07:39.592 --> 07:43.961
<i>You offer your lukewarm feelings...
That's why I was always uneasy.</i>

07:44.263 --> 07:48.427
I was happy to see your face
every time but felt uneasy too.

07:48.534 --> 07:49.660
So...

07:55.842 --> 07:57.070
So...

07:59.278 --> 08:00.506
Yasuna...

08:18.231 --> 08:19.425
Hazumu!

08:23.002 --> 08:24.026
Hazumu!

08:24.604 --> 08:25.536
Hazumu!

09:31.504 --> 09:33.802
It's all my fault...

09:38.177 --> 09:39.235
Tomari.

09:39.679 --> 09:41.169
H-Hey...

09:41.914 --> 09:43.313
You're back.

09:43.416 --> 09:44.246
Yeah...

09:44.917 --> 09:47.442
<i>I wanted to talk to you.</i>

09:49.121 --> 09:52.352
Well, it's about the other day...

09:52.658 --> 09:53.784
Sorry.

09:56.495 --> 09:59.123
My feelings for you won't change.

09:59.765 --> 10:02.290
I'm not going to give up on you.

10:02.568 --> 10:05.298
Why are you telling me this now?

10:05.938 --> 10:08.304
Because ll like you...

10:10.443 --> 10:12.138
1 finally understood.

10:12.244 --> 10:15.509
I don't want Yasuna
to take you away from me.

10:15.615 --> 10:18.516
I don't want to give
you up to anyone, so...

10:19.118 --> 10:20.244
Hazumu...

10:21.387 --> 10:24.720
Yasuna is suffering because of me.

10:26.359 --> 10:29.658
I can't think about you
at a time like this!

10:33.766 --> 10:35.961
Then why don't you say it...

10:36.068 --> 10:39.037
That you like Yasuna more than me.

10:39.271 --> 10:41.603
That you'll take her over me!

10:41.707 --> 10:44.505
I came here because I'm serious.

10:53.152 --> 10:54.483
You idiot...

10:57.556 --> 10:59.922
You're an idiot, Hazumu...

11:08.100 --> 11:11.069
<i>I want to stay by her side...</i>

11:12.872 --> 11:15.898
I can't think about you
at a time like this!

11:18.377 --> 11:19.674
Damn it...

11:23.182 --> 11:24.149
Huh?

11:27.853 --> 11:28.717
Tomari.

11:29.121 --> 11:31.055
So you're back?

11:33.459 --> 11:39.056
Why do you always
show up at times like these?

11:40.332 --> 11:41.594
Tomari...

11:43.335 --> 11:47.897
<i>You're all I have...
Let me cry on your shoulder...</i>

12:20.473 --> 12:23.101
Huh? ll have this too.

12:23.275 --> 12:27.075
Then maybe we were listening
to it around the same time.

12:31.417 --> 12:33.351
I was really surprised.

12:33.552 --> 12:36.020
You called early in the morning.

12:36.122 --> 12:38.886
Sorry for calling
you out all of a sudden...

12:38.991 --> 12:41.653
I don't mind at all.
Where's Kamiizumi?

12:41.794 --> 12:43.227
Well...

12:43.963 --> 12:45.692
Something came up...

12:46.632 --> 12:47.758
ll see...

12:48.400 --> 12:49.662
Anyway...

12:50.069 --> 12:52.833
Do you want to go
some place after this?

12:53.806 --> 12:55.535
I'll treat you. Okay?

12:55.841 --> 12:58.639
Well, if you say so...

12:59.578 --> 13:01.705
But did something happen?

13:02.481 --> 13:03.743
It's nothing...

13:04.283 --> 13:06.717
<i>I just don't want to be alone...</i>

13:08.754 --> 13:10.881
So let's have lots of fun!

13:10.990 --> 13:13.515
All right then. I'll hang out with you.

13:13.626 --> 13:15.093
You're treating, right?

13:15.194 --> 13:16.388
A little.

13:16.495 --> 13:20.454
A little? I don't have much
allowance left for this month.

13:25.437 --> 13:26.563
I..

13:27.907 --> 13:29.875
...won't go on the stage.

13:32.545 --> 13:33.409
But...

13:41.587 --> 13:42.918
What's this?

13:44.390 --> 13:46.119
Oh, that...

13:46.458 --> 13:51.760
You usually get rid of the one that isn't
growing, but they're about the same size.

13:51.864 --> 13:52.990
I see.

13:53.098 --> 13:55.658
I was wondering
what to do with them...

14:03.342 --> 14:05.435
What are you doing, Ayuki?

14:06.579 --> 14:08.979
This is what you have to do, right?

14:09.081 --> 14:10.207
Ayuki...

14:10.983 --> 14:12.017
You know this is...

14:12.017 --> 14:13.575
You know this is...
Asuta.

14:13.686 --> 14:16.211
I'd like some privacy.

14:18.757 --> 14:23.387
You already know that
you can't make both plants grow.

14:23.796 --> 14:27.857
If you let them grow at
the same pace, they'll wither and die.

14:28.901 --> 14:31.131
But you just won't choose.

14:31.570 --> 14:35.904
You grow them both with the same
amount of love, and you let them die.

14:36.008 --> 14:39.808
Then you'll cry about it.
You'll say, "It was my fault."

14:39.912 --> 14:43.211
<i>“It's because I didn't
choose between the two."</i>

14:44.984 --> 14:49.853
But those tears are not meant for
the flowers that withered and died.

14:50.789 --> 14:54.384
They're meant for you,
whom couldn't see them blossom.

14:54.493 --> 14:57.951
You shed those tears
since you couldn't get anything.

15:01.033 --> 15:04.093
Why didn't you give her an answer?

15:04.203 --> 15:06.171
Tomari was serious.

15:06.272 --> 15:09.036
In fact, Yasuna was serious too.

15:09.475 --> 15:12.911
They were both ready
to be turned down and hurt.

15:13.012 --> 15:15.139
But you were afraid.

15:15.547 --> 15:19.677
You were afraid you might get hurt.
You were afraid to hurt others.

15:20.552 --> 15:23.851
I don't want to hurt anyone.

15:23.956 --> 15:25.890
Isn't that obvious?

15:26.625 --> 15:29.526
You can hurt them
much more than you think.

15:29.762 --> 15:33.493
If that's how it'll be,
then I'm not interested in love...

15:36.902 --> 15:39.200
I'm disappointed in you.

15:46.178 --> 15:49.545
What's the plan, Hazumu?
Still want to go have fun?

15:49.648 --> 15:50.615
Sorry.

15:50.950 --> 15:52.918
I think I'll go home.

15:53.452 --> 15:55.386
Nurse's Office

15:55.955 --> 15:58.549
You have circles under your eyes!

15:59.224 --> 16:01.852
You shouldn't run
that much on no sleep!

16:01.961 --> 16:04.225
It's not that I'm sleep-deprived...

16:04.330 --> 16:06.855
So she says with such a pale face.

16:06.966 --> 16:08.695
Just get some sleep!

16:08.801 --> 16:09.768
Bye...

16:12.938 --> 16:15.634
<i>How could I possibly sleep?</i>

16:20.379 --> 16:21.311
Yes.

16:21.847 --> 16:23.474
Yes, that's right.

16:25.117 --> 16:26.414
I'm sorry...

16:26.852 --> 16:29.184
I'll see you at Kashima Mountain.

16:30.389 --> 16:34.621
<i>Mama. I want you to take care
of that stuff at Grandma's house.</i>

16:37.696 --> 16:39.186
Sister Brother...

16:42.468 --> 16:44.766
Oh, Sister Brother!

16:44.870 --> 16:47.600
Oh, you're back? Welcome back...

16:47.840 --> 16:50.866
<i>No! I don't like goodbyes!</i>

16:50.976 --> 16:54.537
Tears become a large river
that flows into the sea!

16:54.646 --> 16:55.670
Leaving?

16:55.781 --> 16:56.805
Right.

16:57.316 --> 16:59.477
I couldn't get good results.

16:59.952 --> 17:01.920
So we're leaving this planet.

17:02.554 --> 17:03.521
Results?

17:04.156 --> 17:07.990
Improvement of her symptoms.
Yasuna Kamiizumi, that is.

17:09.895 --> 17:14.662
We accidentally found her
to be a very important specimen.

17:15.367 --> 17:18.803
We wanted to stay
here on this planet...

17:19.038 --> 17:23.270
...to see how her symptoms
would change after falling in love.

17:23.609 --> 17:24.974
Kurusu?

17:26.712 --> 17:30.045
But unfortunately,
she didn't show any improvement.

17:30.582 --> 17:34.143
Wait a minute.
Why does it have to be Yasuna?

17:34.253 --> 17:39.486
Her symptoms can be seen in
the people of our planet as well.

17:39.858 --> 17:41.325
Symptoms?

17:41.593 --> 17:43.288
It's such a hassle...

17:43.395 --> 17:45.829
<i>I don't know what you're saying!</i>

17:47.166 --> 17:51.865
<i>I had no intention of telling you this,
but I guess I have no choice.</i>

17:51.970 --> 17:55.167
As civilization evolved on our planet...

17:55.274 --> 17:58.402
...we started losing
interest in other people.

17:58.510 --> 18:00.501
Lost interest in others?

18:00.612 --> 18:01.510
Right.

18:02.414 --> 18:06.544
You could say we lost interest
in communicating with others.

18:06.652 --> 18:11.146
As a result, we couldn't
distinguish A from B.

18:11.924 --> 18:15.223
For example, this planet's
people can't distinguish...

18:15.327 --> 18:18.262
...between birds of the same species.

18:18.363 --> 18:21.025
Insects, animals, plants...

18:21.567 --> 18:24.593
Same species or not,
they have differences.

18:24.703 --> 18:28.730
People on this planet lost
the ability to differentiate them.

18:28.841 --> 18:31.571
Our planet's people see others...

18:31.677 --> 18:34.669
...as uniform and cannot
make the distinction.

18:34.913 --> 18:39.441
Just like Yasuna Kamiizumi
can't see male human beings...

18:40.953 --> 18:46.118
If there is a cure for that, it's of
strong interest for the other party.

18:46.225 --> 18:48.090
In other words, love.

18:48.360 --> 18:51.295
That's why you
encouraged me and Yasuna...

18:51.396 --> 18:54.422
But you chose
not to engage in romance...

18:54.533 --> 18:57.525
...and Yasuna Kamiizumi's
symptoms worsened.

18:57.636 --> 18:59.831
Waiting any longer is pointless.

18:59.938 --> 19:01.064
Hold on!

19:03.542 --> 19:06.306
Then in order to cure Yasuna...

19:09.248 --> 19:12.684
To cure her, she has
to fall in love with someone.

19:14.419 --> 19:16.944
You can't tell
the difference between men?

19:17.055 --> 19:21.389
<i>Right. I can sometimes
tell by their voices or clothes.</i>

19:21.493 --> 19:25.452
You never saw me talk to Soro, right?

19:27.799 --> 19:30.233
Those symptoms got worse...

19:30.569 --> 19:34.232
<i>...and now I can't even
see you. Or Hazumu.</i>

19:34.339 --> 19:35.931
That can't be...

19:36.775 --> 19:37.901
So...

19:38.710 --> 19:40.041
Hazumu...

19:50.556 --> 19:55.459
If Hazumu sees me like this,
she'll try to stay by my side.

19:56.428 --> 19:58.658
She won't want to leave...

20:01.200 --> 20:03.464
<i>But I don't want that!</i>

20:04.169 --> 20:07.627
It's going to be
painful for both of us, so...

20:10.309 --> 20:12.140
Stop lying...

20:15.113 --> 20:17.809
I'm telling you to stop pretending.

20:20.419 --> 20:23.320
You want Hazumu
to be by your side.

20:23.722 --> 20:26.691
Even though it hurts,
and you can't see...

20:28.227 --> 20:29.159
Right?

20:39.705 --> 20:42.435
What Hazumu needs is you.

20:44.876 --> 20:45.543
But...

20:45.544 --> 20:47.171
But...
More than me.

20:47.746 --> 20:52.183
Hazumu needs you
much more than me.

21:04.763 --> 21:07.425
We met here that time...

21:10.569 --> 21:14.437
We were both trying
hard to save Hazumu.

21:16.008 --> 21:18.772
I watched you then and understood.

21:18.877 --> 21:21.903
That you also liked Hazumu...

21:24.316 --> 21:25.806
I was miffed...

21:26.018 --> 21:27.485
I was sad...

21:27.586 --> 21:29.144
I felt uneasy...

21:33.191 --> 21:35.557
But I'm glad...

21:36.328 --> 21:38.523
...that it was you.

21:39.865 --> 21:40.991
Thanks.

21:44.169 --> 21:45.466
Tomari...

21:46.471 --> 21:49.235
You can say
my name naturally now.

21:49.608 --> 21:50.734
Yeah.

21:53.712 --> 21:55.805
Thank you, Tomari.

22:14.399 --> 22:18.802
Hazumu needs you
much more than me.

22:19.705 --> 22:21.104
Thank you...

22:21.340 --> 22:22.398
Hazumu needs you
much more than me.

22:33.719 --> 22:39.487
But...

22:40.292 --> 22:46.663
<i>...then I can be with you forever.</i>

22:46.832 --> 22:52.600
I asked you a question,
and the answer that you gave...

22:53.271 --> 22:59.176
...provided
the strength for me to rise.

23:01.246 --> 23:07.412
Looking for the truth...
I was searching for...

23:07.819 --> 23:14.520
...the blue sky since that time.

23:15.961 --> 23:21.797
Let's overcome
the sadness and be happy.

23:22.434 --> 23:28.805
<i>Should I put my trust
in a future that I can't see?</i>

23:28.940 --> 23:35.038
<i>Your smiley face is about to cry...
I promise to turn it into something bright.</i>

23:35.247 --> 23:42.380
Stay by my side.
Don't let go of this hand.

23:45.090 --> 23:48.992
Our future is just around the corner.

23:56.001 --> 24:01.496
When your warmth and
your thoughts cover the world...

24:01.840 --> 24:04.570
Next time on Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~.

24:04.676 --> 24:06.644
Love Begins at Last.

24:06.745 --> 24:09.236
These feelings... in my heart.
